<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Nov industrial output down 1pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Hungary Nov industrial output down 1pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial output dropped a seasonally-adjusted one percent in November compared with October, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise in November was 5.9 percent, the KSH said.  </p>
<p>		     Jan-Nov'96  Jan-Oct'96  Nov'96  Oct'96  Nov '95</p>
<p> Monthly change    n.a.	   n.a.     -1.0    +3.8     -3.7</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change  +2.3	   +2.0	+5.9    +5.8     +0.7</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
